--------------------------------------------------------------------------
ABOUT THE FIRMWARE FLASHER SPECIFICALLY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`egg-flash` erases and rewrites the firmware of a physical device. A failed or
interrupted flash can leave a mouse that does not work, and that may not be
covered by any warranty. The Apache License's Sections 7 and 8 ("AS IS",
without warranties or conditions of any kind, and no liability for damages)
apply to this in full and are not decorative here. Read them before you run it.

The author has tested this against exactly one mouse, of one model, on two
firmware versions. It has never been run against any other hardware.
